    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d189-a1">

                <pb facs="0376" n="248" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg248"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Scrymser to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 4,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Kindly inform Señor Becerra his message to General Gónima, Panama, cannot be
                    delivered. He is a prisoner in hands of Radicals who have taken Panama, nor can
                    we yet deliver his message to Colonel Ulloa, Colon. He is seriously wounded at
                    Colon. Señor Becerra will gain time by wiring direct from Washington.</p>
                <closer><signed>SCRYMSER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
